msgid "QuantumCircuit.qasm {#quantumcircuitqasm}"
msgstr "QuantumCircuit.qasm {#quantumcircuitqasm}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `QuantumCircuit.qasm` method has been removed. Instead, use\n"
"[`qasm2.dump`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2#dump) or\n"
"[`qasm2.dumps`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2#dumps).\n"
msgstr ""
"`QuantumCircuit.qasm` 메서드가 제거되었습니다. 대신,\n"
"[`qasm2.dump`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2#dump) 또는\n"
"[`qasm2.dumps`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2#dumps)를 사용하세요.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For Pygments-formatted output, look at the standalone\n"
"[`openqasm-pygments`](https://pypi.org/project/openqasm-pygments/) package,\n"
"as `qasm2.dump` and `qasm2.dumps` do not provide Pygments-colored output.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pygments 형식의 출력을 원한다면, `qasm2.dump`와 `qasm2.dumps`는 Pygments 색상 출력을\n"
"제공하지 않으므로 독립형 [`openqasm-pygments`](https://pypi.org/project/openqasm-pygments/)\n"
"패키지를 확인하세요.\n"

