msgstr "basicaer {#basicaer-1}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Most of the functionality in the `qiskit.providers.basicaer` module has been\n"
"replaced with the new\n"
"[`qiskit.providers.basic_provider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/providers_basic_provider)\n"
"module, except for the `UnitarySimulatorPy` and `StatevectorSimulatorPy`\n"
"classes, which have been removed; their functionality was already contained in\n"
"the [`quantum_info`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/quantum_info) module.\n"
msgstr ""
"`qiskit.providers.basicaer` 모듈의 대부분 기능이 새로운\n"
"[`qiskit.providers.basic_provider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/providers_basic_provider)\n"
"모듈로 대체되었습니다. 단, `UnitarySimulatorPy`와 `StatevectorSimulatorPy` 클래스는\n"
"제거되었으며, 해당 기능은 이미 [`quantum_info`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/quantum_info) 모듈에 포함되어 있었습니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The migration to the new paths is straightforward. You can replace most\n"
"classes in `qiskit.providers.basicaer` with their\n"
"[`qiskit.providers.basic_provider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/providers_basic_provider)\n"
"counterpart (drop-in replacement). Note that the following classes have\n"
"new paths and names:\n"
msgstr ""
"새 경로로의 마이그레이션은 간단합니다. `qiskit.providers.basicaer`의 대부분 클래스를\n"
"[`qiskit.providers.basic_provider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/providers_basic_provider)\n"
"대응 항목으로 바꿀 수 있습니다(드롭인 대체). 다음 클래스는 새 경로와 이름을 가집니다:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Removed                          | Alternative\n"
"---------------------------------|--------------------------------------------\n"
"`qiskit.providers.basicaer`                            |  [`qiskit.providers.basic_provider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/providers_basic_provider)\n"
"`BasicAerProvider`             |  [`BasicProvider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.basic_provider.BasicProvider)\n"
"`BasicAerJob`                       |  [`BasicProviderJob`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.basic_provider.BasicProviderJob)\n"
"`QasmSimulatorPy`               |  [`BasicSimulator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.basic_provider.BasicSimulator)\n"
msgstr ""
"제거됨                          | 대안\n"
"---------------------------------|--------------------------------------------\n"
"`qiskit.providers.basicaer`                            |  [`qiskit.providers.basic_provider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/providers_basic_provider)\n"
"`BasicAerProvider`             |  [`BasicProvider`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.basic_provider.BasicProvider)\n"
"`BasicAerJob`                       |  [`BasicProviderJob`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.basic_provider.BasicProviderJob)\n"
"`QasmSimulatorPy`               |  [`BasicSimulator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.basic_provider.BasicSimulator)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Global instances\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"caution\" title=\"전역 인스턴스\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Be aware of any global instances when migrating to the new module. There is no replacement for\n"
"the `BasicAer` global instance that could be directly imported as `qiskit.BasicAer`. This means that\n"
" `from qiskit import BasicProvider` is no longer a valid import.\n"
"Instead, the provider class must be imported from its submodule and instantiated by the user:\n"
msgstr ""
"새 모듈로 마이그레이션할 때 전역 인스턴스에 주의하세요. `qiskit.BasicAer`로 직접 임포트할 수 있었던\n"
"`BasicAer` 전역 인스턴스에 대한 대체는 없습니다. 이는\n"
" `from qiskit import BasicProvider`가 더 이상 유효한 임포트가 아님을 의미합니다.\n"
"대신, 프로바이더 클래스를 서브모듈에서 임포트하고 사용자가 인스턴스화해야 합니다:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The unitary and statevector simulators can be replaced with\n"
"different [`quantum_info`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/quantum_info) classes. This is not a\n"
"drop-in replacement, but the changes are minimal. See the following migration\n"
"examples:\n"
msgstr ""
"유니터리 및 상태 벡터 시뮬레이터는 다른 "
"[`quantum_info`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/quantum_info) 클래스로 "
"대체할 수 있습니다. 드롭인 대체는 아니지만 변경 사항은 최소한입니다. 다음 마이그레이션 예제를 참조하세요:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Removed                          |   Alternative\n"
"---------------------------------|--------------------------------------------\n"
